<title>GERMANY: German February Ifo index rises to 93.6 vs 93.3.</title>
<headline>German February Ifo index rises to 93.6 vs 93.3.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German Ifo economics institute gave the following data from its February business climate survey:</p>
<p>    West Germany		    February 1997 January 1997</p>
<p>     Business climate		  93.6		 93.3</p>
<p>     Business conditions	     84.4		 84.1</p>
<p>     Business expectations	   104.0	     103.6</p>
<p>    East Germany		     February 1997 January 1997</p>
<p>     Business climate		  104.1		106.5</p>
<p>     Business conditions	     119.6		123.2</p>
<p>     Business expectations	   90.1		  91.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Economists polled by Reuters forcast on average an west German Ifo business climate index of 94.4 for February.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
